  m_text: "The skyline has a new crown jewel as the Grand Sentinel Hotel officially
    opened its doors today. Mayor Reed led the ribbon-cutting ceremony, hailing the
    glass-and-marble tower as a beacon of urban renewal. With 300 luxury rooms and
    the opulent Gilded Lily restaurant, the $12 million project is expected to draw
    major conventions back to our streets. While some critics questioned the tax
    breaks, the creation of 250 local jobs offers a promising spark for our city\u2019s
    economy this autumn season."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d9b65d2b1b633049ae14384af3883c7, type: 2}
